{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0163_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0a9be590ac8019668a643c78b9bd0f1abd130b41b8e7b9fd5f359807bd523ac4", "ja": "（アイドル達が出演するのは、近未来を舞台にした\nSF映画。撮影は、もうすぐクランクアップだ）", "zh": "（偶像们出演的是一部以近未来为舞台的科幻电影。拍摄马上就要杀青了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0163_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "f8c251c79cc957e5e8b699a123eba61245c658999a784d8e8095d28fab24711e", "ja": "仕掛け人さま、お疲れさまです。\n本日もよろしくお願いいたします！", "zh": "制作人先生，辛苦了。\n今天也请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0163_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c82066859ecebfa76fc5f5224017e192503279ac141062a36ca59e16e12d0df9", "ja": "お疲れ様、エミリー。今日はなんだか、\nいつも以上に気合いが入ってるみたいだな？", "zh": "辛苦了，艾米莉。你今天好像比平时更有干劲啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0163_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "bfb2273dcec6651bc6c588294350377aac36779fb9588d4e4bfe5c717a941526", "ja": "はい！　先日、歌の撮影がうまくいって、\nとてもほっとしたのですが……。", "zh": "是的！前些天的歌曲拍摄进展得很顺利，我也着实松了口气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0163_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "40604b8002a90752461ed45a9bf1c98dc2236403dc2538b878487ca5b355e935", "ja": "そのせいか、改めて今回の近未来異分子が\n楽しくなって参りました。まるで時代劇のようで……。", "zh": "也许正因为如此，我反而越发觉得这次的《近未来异分子》有趣了。简直就像时代剧一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0163_1005_p", "source_sha256": "116de59779a05af878764dd7529a0ecd90feb8b2750e7724ee9f7c3e59d068e6", "ja": "えっ、時代劇？\nとてもそうは思えないけど……。", "zh": "诶，时代剧？\n我可完全没觉得像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0163_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "7be0b711750d61b46d2de9412b8e2accba29de516b68fb7a9ef7a1e71fa079cb", "ja": "いいえ！　一介の浪人が、守りたい弱きもののため、\n大いなる権力へと立ち向かう……。", "zh": "不！一介浪人为了守护想要保护的弱者，挺身对抗强大的权力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0163_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "15ce3e54efc29cbbe6207abeddfaf265086be22518d8588ff6d682cbb8a3f0b3", "ja": "これぞ、正統派の時代劇です！\n世界観は空想科学ですが、本質は侍なんですよ♪", "zh": "这才是正统派的时代剧！\n虽然世界观属于空想科学，但本质上就是武士哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0163_1008_p", "source_sha256": "823f4ab09da93d7d3b8701245397b1702d0e567a3b977e96f5e03b6992725ec5", "ja": "（浪人って、アウトローの事かな……）", "zh": "所谓浪人，是指法外之徒吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0163_1009_p", "source_sha256": "879cf90d76239a55f81fd86d0d12576ad3f3fd8e26b9b4df5253c43aacb6f9cb", "ja": "なるほど……言われてみると、確かに……\nそういう意味では、時代劇っぽい部分もあるのかな。", "zh": "原来如此……你这么一说，确实……\n从这个意义上来说，或许也有些地方挺像时代剧的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0163_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "5f56c4284b513eb0aeb2db26f1ee2b0bc30414298c73c0ba49e48b59113f4d05", "ja": "はい！　なので、今回とても\n素敵な作品に関われて、光栄に思います。", "zh": "是的！所以这次能参与这么棒的作品，我感到非常荣幸。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0163_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "775849002eeaab49e52a115686872e50f9c90bb9ee0130660eb61a5ce73f389a", "ja": "ですが、ひとつ気になるところがあって……。", "zh": "不过，有一点让我有些在意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0163_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3eb4cc57cbc9c98e3cf0040c022af26b93c7dc155190725e842a1a60129274aa", "ja": "気になるところ？", "zh": "让人在意的地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0163_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "40cf07835fe2bb70267498551a210aab83792b69a704662c3a1d39bcd7f4ed1b", "ja": "はい。近未来異分子で戦うのは、黄昏と破壊刃。\nアマリリスは、ただ助けられるのを待つばかりです。", "zh": "是的。以近未来异分子的身份战斗的，是黄昏和破坏刃。\n阿玛丽利丝只是在等待有人来帮助自己而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0163_1014_p", "source_sha256": "1a44aad239e7073db531f80c0a4d420780a5209fbfedb968876b492ce6bba674", "ja": "黄昏と破壊刃……\nああ、ダスクとバスターブレイドの事か。それで？", "zh": "黄昏与破坏刃……啊，是指达斯克和巴斯特布雷德吧。然后呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0163_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "0c74475db407b86dac0975920835ae5b24aa4f0545355dc7f25f301dec9ca714", "ja": "アマリリスも大和撫子ならば、自ら\n武器をとって戦うべきではないのでしょうか？", "zh": "既然阿玛莉莉丝也是大和抚子，不是应该亲自拿起武器战斗吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0163_1016_p", "source_sha256": "5802e28825dde015ed9e67c091f470d84269e04a575b4aeab1fc28cf4b83f2e8", "ja": "あれ、そうなのか？　戦うなんて\nお淑やかじゃないって言うのかと思ったのに。", "zh": "咦，是这样吗？我还以为你会说\n战斗这种事一点都不端庄呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0163_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "1d5fbe7d632ea3a0987d05d8a47a21e8ab4a25fdf7b379906bcbfcd6c3f95e66", "ja": "そんなことはありません。無法者がはびこる世界で\n大切なものがあるならば、恐ろしくとも戦わなくては！", "zh": "并不是那回事。在无法无天之徒横行的世界里，\n如果有珍视之物，就算害怕也必须战斗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0163_1018_032emi", "source_sha256": "a9750be4ae745f2788f5ecae73684cc19295456e4dfbea2071ab19ee62a80ede", "ja": "なので仕掛け人さま、どうか\nご心配なさらないでくださいね。", "zh": "所以制作人，请您不要担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0163_1019_032emi", "source_sha256": "05589ea49d61a4f5dd2ef63c32ac0496afcb329546aa26eed4fc2e206f16965b", "ja": "万が一、終末の日に支配されたとしても……\n私が仕掛け人さまを守ってさしあげます！", "zh": "即使万一被末日支配了……\n我也会保护制作人您的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
